NOTICE: This MIT License applies ONLY to the FREE/CORE components of Clarity Chat.

Premium features, enterprise components, and advanced functionality require
a separate commercial license. See LICENSE-PRO.md and LICENSE-ENTERPRISE.md
for commercial licensing terms.

Free/Core Components Include:
- @clarity-chat/primitives (all components)
- @clarity-chat/types (all type definitions)
- Basic components from @clarity-chat/react:
  * Button, Input, Textarea, Card, Avatar, Badge
  * Message, MessageList, ChatInput, ChatWindow (basic)
  * Basic themes (default, dark, minimal)
  * Core hooks (use-chat, use-debounce, use-clipboard)
  * Basic utilities

Premium/Commercial Components Require License:
- Advanced AI features (sentiment analysis, content moderation, PII detection)
- Advanced components (VoiceInput, FileUpload, CommandPalette, ContextMenu)
- Premium themes (ocean, glassmorphism, sunset, forest, corporate, neon)
- Enterprise components (SSOConfigWizard, AuthTenantDashboard, ApiTokenManager)
- Analytics integrations (GA4, Mixpanel, PostHog, Amplitude)
- Error tracking integrations (Sentry, Rollbar, Bugsnag)
- Advanced hooks (use-performance, use-optimistic-message, use-error-recovery)
- AI provider adapters (OpenAI, Anthropic, Azure, etc.)
- Vector stores and RAG features
- Agent orchestration features

For commercial use of premium features, please visit:
https://clarity-chat.dev/pricing

For enterprise inquiries:
support@codeclarity.ai

